@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@gatewayToken = REPLACE_WITH_PRIVATE_BACKEND_GATEWAY_JWT
@callerToken = REPLACE_WITH_APPROVED_CUSTOMER_JWT
@proposalId = REPLACE_WITH_PROPOSAL_ID
@proposalHash = REPLACE_WITH_EXACT_PROPOSAL_HASH
@confirmationGrant = REPLACE_AFTER_DELIBERATE_HUMAN_CONFIRMATION
@caseId = REPLACE_WITH_CALLER_OWNED_CASE_ID
@sessionId = REPLACE_WITH_CALLER_OWNED_SESSION_ID
@idempotencyKey = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000010

### Public bootstrap (append /support to baseUrl when configured behind APIM)
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/config

### Liveness, not provider health
GET {{baseUrl}}/health/live

### Binding readiness, not a live-provider probe
GET {{baseUrl}}/health/ready

### Private backend examples use BOTH tokens; public APIM callers send only caller Authorization
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/customer
Authorization: Bearer {{gatewayToken}}
X-Harbor-Caller-Authorization: Bearer {{callerToken}}

###
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/company
Authorization: Bearer {{gatewayToken}}
X-Harbor-Caller-Authorization: Bearer {{callerToken}}

###
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/services
Authorization: Bearer {{gatewayToken}}
X-Harbor-Caller-Authorization: Bearer {{callerToken}}

### Explicitly synthetic status
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/status/microsoft-365
Authorization: Bearer {{gatewayToken}}
X-Harbor-Caller-Authorization: Bearer {{callerToken}}

###
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/knowledge/search?serviceId=microsoft-365&q=Harbor%20Outlook%20sign-in%20guidance
Authorization: Bearer {{gatewayToken}}
X-Harbor-Caller-Authorization: Bearer {{callerToken}}

###
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/cases
Authorization: Bearer {{gatewayToken}}
X-Harbor-Caller-Authorization: Bearer {{callerToken}}

###
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/cases/{{caseId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{gatewayToken}}
X-Harbor-Caller-Authorization: Bearer {{callerToken}}

### This creates only an expiring proposal, not a case
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/case-proposals
Authorization: Bearer {{gatewayToken}}
X-Harbor-Caller-Authorization: Bearer {{callerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"serviceId":"microsoft-365","subject":"Synthetic Outlook sign-in issue","summary":"Fictional test description only; no customer data.","impact":"low"}

###
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/case-proposals/{{proposalId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{gatewayToken}}
X-Harbor-Caller-Authorization: Bearer {{callerToken}}

### Deliberate human action only: review the exact proposal first, never execute as a model/MCP tool
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/case-proposals/{{proposalId}}/confirmation
Authorization: Bearer {{gatewayToken}}
X-Harbor-Caller-Authorization: Bearer {{callerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"proposalHash":"{{proposalHash}}","intent":"create_case"}

### Commit/retry only the exact original hash/grant and stable GUID key
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/case-proposals/{{proposalId}}/commit
Authorization: Bearer {{gatewayToken}}
X-Harbor-Caller-Authorization: Bearer {{callerToken}}
Idempotency-Key: {{idempotencyKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"proposalHash":"{{proposalHash}}","confirmationGrant":"{{confirmationGrant}}"}

###
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/chat/messages
Authorization: Bearer {{gatewayToken}}
X-Harbor-Caller-Authorization: Bearer {{callerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"serviceId":"microsoft-365","message":"What safe Outlook sign-in checks does Harbor recommend?"}

### Requires separate microphone/processing consent, reserves the bounded lab allowance
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/voice/sessions
Authorization: Bearer {{gatewayToken}}
X-Harbor-Caller-Authorization: Bearer {{callerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"consent":true}

###
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/v1/voice/sessions/{{sessionId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{gatewayToken}}
X-Harbor-Caller-Authorization: Bearer {{callerToken}}

### No upgrade: 400 (real WSS uses gateway JWT, approved Origin and two ticket subprotocols)
GET {{baseUrl}}/voice/socket?sessionId={{sessionId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{gatewayToken}}

### Unauthorized request: must fail closed
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/cases

### Unknown service: 404
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/status/not-a-harbor-service
Authorization: Bearer {{gatewayToken}}
X-Harbor-Caller-Authorization: Bearer {{callerToken}}
